      "message": "The name `getAllCodePoints` is generic and doesn\u0027t state what these do. These are more like `computeCodeUnitFlags` or something like that.\n\nWorse though is that these are named the same but actually set different sets of flags and don\u0027t do the same thing. From the naming I would expect these to do exactly the same thing, just one works on UTF-16 and one on UTF-8, but the same string in either encoding would logically produce similar output (the same set of flags in the same order, but maybe a different number of repetitions of each flag).",
